    thinking: "**Verifying Compilation Success**\n\nThe compilation was flawless, generating zero warnings! I\'m now verifying the absence of any environmental secrets or background servers, as this project is intended to be a purely client-side SPA by design.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully created **Banquet Pro**\342\200\224a high-fidelity, premium banquet and catering management application. The applet is optimized for luxury event venues, combining offline-first local persistence with real-time back-office operations.\n\nThe application incorporates all of your requested layouts and workflows, styled with an **Imperial Slate Theme** utilizing elegant high-contrast margins, balanced negative space, and custom color accents:\n\n### Key Features & Design Choices\n\n*   **Imperial Slate Theme & Typographic Hierarchy**: Formatted the workspace with a high-contrast layout utilizing elegant **Space Grotesk** display titles paired with **Inter** for responsive body copy and **JetBrains Mono** for invoice balances and dates.\n*   **Active Dashboard Overview**:\n    *   Interactive statistical bento cards displaying real-time metrics for total enquiries, active bookings, daily events, and monthly turnovers.\n    *   Includes a formatting toggle to view metrics instantly in either **INR (Lakhs)** or **USD ($)**.\n    *   Responsive shortcut buttons to register leads or issue contract agreements immediately.\n*   **Enquiries & Lead Nurturing Hub**:\n    *   Filterable pipelines (All, New, Contacted, Negotiating) with custom logos for referral sources (WeddingWire, Instagram Ads, Direct Web, WhatsApp).\n    *   Slide-out Client Detail panel featuring WhatsApp verification checks, an interactive **timestamped notes logger** (adds real-time client history logs), and a direct conversion workflow.\n*   **Bookings & Billing Ledger**:\n    *   Maintains contracts with automatic ID generation (`#BP-XXXXX`) and active status tags (Fully Paid, Partially Paid, Overdue).\n    *   Slide-out billing pane calculating discounts, tax subtotals, and final contract value. Includes an interactive **Record Payment** utility to register partial cash/wire collections dynamically.\n*   **Interactive Calendar Planner**:\n    *   A dynamic day-grid engine mapping confirmed bookings and enquiries directly to calendar cells.\n    *   Selecting any cell displays a comprehensive timeline agenda highlighting hall availability, guest pax limits, and conflict flags.\n*   **Catering Menu & Back-Office Settings**:\n    *   Menu category tabs (Starters, Mains, Desserts, Drinks) featuring dish photography, ingredient descriptions, and live inventory availability switches.\n    *   An operator switcher panel allowing you to toggle between administrator profiles (updating greeting names and active avatars application-wide) and allocate new venue spaces.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 569782751
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
