h `gap-2 sm:gap-4 ml-2 sm:ml-4`, and the profile button/bell icon\'s padding for compactness and alignment on smaller screens. I also adjusted the header\'s `lg:pl-72` padding to ensure appropriate screen spacing.\n\n\n**Optimizing Responsiveness Further**\n\nI\'m now refining the desktop layout for improved responsiveness, specifically the header. I\'ve switched the `lg:pl-72` padding to `lg:pl-72 px-4 sm:px-6 py-4` to address potential screen overflow. It feels great, and now I\'m optimizing inner elements, like the actions list and profile button/bell icon\'s padding. This helps to achieve better compactness and alignment on smaller displays.\n\n\n"
