ow budget-related information more comprehensively, including selected catering menu details. I will include status update buttons in the sidebar to modify Enquiry status. I\'ll include `New`, `Contacted`, `Negotiating`, `Confirmed`, and `Lost` as buttons. I\'m checking `EnquiriesView.tsx`, specifically lines 292 to 310, for existing status code.\n\n\n"
