t sub-states with the main `tenants` state, writing changes back to `localStorage`. I\'m updating the `tenants` state whenever any sub-state changes, like enquiries or bookings. This ensures data consistency and efficient state management. Saving both the `tenants` array and `activeTenantId` in `localStorage` persists all changes.\n\n\n"
