ng dal halwa\n\342\200\242 Lokhi halwa\n\342\200\242 Gajar ka halwa\n \n \nICE CREAM COUNTER\n \nDURING PHEREE\n \n\342\200\242 Coffee / Tea\n\342\200\242 Water bottles\n\342\200\242 Kaju katli,\n\342\200\242 Dry fruit\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nWHISKEY SPL.\n \n\342\200\242 Water bottles 1lts\n\342\200\242 Soda\n\342\200\242 Ice cube\n\342\200\242 Pinut masla\n\342\200\242 Chakana\n\342\200\242 Dry Papad\n\342\200\242 Masala papad\n\342\200\242 Corn chaat\n\342\200\242 channa chaat\n\342\200\242 peanut masala\n\342\200\242 live snakes\n \n \n \n \n \nTREAM& CONDITIONS\n \n    TIMING FOR PROGRAMMA\n>FOR CHAT STALL & FRESH FRUIT 8pm to 11:30pm\n>FOR DINNAR   9pm to 12:30pm\n>50% ADVANCE AT THE TIME OF BOOKING\n>BALANCE PAYMENT WILL BE CHARGED AT END OF PROGRAME\n>NO RESPONSIBILITY FOR EXTRA GATHERING\n>EXTRA PLATE HAVE TO BE PAID BY HOST\n\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246\342\200\246."
