  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Successful Build**\n\nI\'m thrilled; the build completed perfectly! I just confirmed the successful update of the catering items list. The new list, under \"SUGGESTED EXOTIC VEGETARIAN MENU\", is fully populated now with all relevant details: Welcome Drinks, Mocktails, Juices, Coffee, Cold Drinks, Starters, Fresh Fruits, Chat Stall, and Salad. I\'m moving on to double-checking the formatting for consistency across the document.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully updated the catering menu and implemented the **Terms and Conditions (\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\256 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\266\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\244\340\245\207\340\244\202)** module as requested! \n\nHere is a summary of the polished changes made:\n\n### \360\237\215\261 1. Exotic Vegetarian & Mocktails Menu Update\nI replaced the basic catering items list in the application database (`src/data.ts`) with your exact, comprehensive, premium **Suggested Exotic Vegetarian Menu**:\n- **Welcome Drinks & Live Mocktails**: *Pan Shake, Mango Shake, Butter Scotch Shake, Coconut Water, Blue Lagoon Mocktail, Thai Mojito, Fresh Lime Soda, and more.*\n- **Live Coffee Espresso & Soft Drinks**: Integrated espresso counters and bottle service configurations.\n- **Starters, Chaat, & Fresh Fruit Stall**: Added *Paneer Malai Tikka, Soya Achari Tikka, Dahi Kabab, Bhalla Papri, Live Moonglete, Pav Bhaji, Panpatta Chaat, Masala Dosa, and Exotic Fresh Fruits (Kiwi, Dragon Fruit, Australian Grapes).*\n- **Main Courses & Curd Bar**: Setup *Lahori Kadai Paneer, Cheese Butter Masala, Palak Corn, Punjabi Saag with Makki Roti, Amritsari Chana & Chur Chur Kulcha, and rich Dal Makhani.*\n- **Delightful Desserts & Halwas**: Integrated *Hot Gulab Jamun, Rasmalai, Live Jalebi with Creamy Rabri, Shahi Tukda, Moong Dal Halwa, and Gajar ka Halwa.*\n\nAll items have been set up with detailed bilingual descriptions and exact pricing mapped to look clean and professional in Indian Rupees (\342\202\271).\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\223\204 2. Terms & Conditions (\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\256 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\266\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\244\340\245\207\340\244\202) Integration\nI designed and integrated a beautiful, high-contrast **Terms & Conditions** widget into both the **New Enquiry Modal** and the **New Booking Drawer**:\n- **Bilingual Layout**: Displays policies elegantly in both English and Hindi.\n- **Program Timings**: Highlights timings for Chat Stall & Fruits (*8:00 PM to 11:30 PM*) and Dinner (*9:00 PM to 12:30 AM*).\n- **Payment Schedule**: Informs customers about the *50% Advance Booking Deposit* and *Balance Due on Completion*.\n- **Extra Plates Policy**: Highlights the extra plate and extra gathering rules.\n- **Copy to WhatsApp Button**: Agents can instantly copy the formatted terms with one click to send directly to customers over WhatsApp or SMS.\n- **Acknowledge Toggle**: Includes a checkbox ensuring that the sales agent has read out and informed the customer about the terms before proceeding.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 143516790
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
