menting and categorizing these additions.\n\n\n**Adding More Items**\n\nI\'ve just added several more catering items to the list. I\'ve categorized them extensively, including \"VEGETABLE COUNTER\" with various dishes, \"AMRITSARI SPL\" items, \"DAL COUNTER\" and \"ORIENTAL CUISINE\" selections. The list has expanded to cover a wide array of options, like \"INDIAN BREADS,\" \"DELIGHTFUL DESSERT,\" \"HALWA COUNTER,\" \"ICE CREAM COUNTER,\" \"DURING PHEREE\" needs, and a \"WHISKEY SPL.\" section.\n\n\n"
