ture.\n\n\n**Expanding Fruit Section**\n\nI\'m now expanding the catalog, adding fresh fruit. I am adding sharda melon, imported kiwi, and an Australian apple, assigning unique IDs, names, descriptions, and setting prices to zero for now. I\'m ensuring their availability is accurately noted. This builds out the item catalog.\n\n\n**Adding Fruit Varieties**\n\nI am now adding several more items to the fresh fruit section, expanding the menu. I\'m incorporating Australian grapes, pineapple, kiwi, papaya, watermelon, guava, and dragon fruit, each with unique IDs, names, and descriptions. Price is set to zero for now, with accurate availability status.\n\n\n**Categorizing Stall Items**\n\nI\'m now cataloging items for the Chat Stall section. I\'ve added Bhalla Papri, Folding Chilla, Boondi Chat, Golgappe, Rajbhog, and Aloo Tikki, including their IDs, names, categories, descriptions and prices. I\'ve marked them as available and am adding `isBestseller` attribute for the Golgappe.\n\n\n**Expanding Stall Options**\n\nI\'ve continued populating the Chat Stall. Now, I have added Moonglete, Pav Bhaji, Panpatta Chaat, Mutter Kulcha, and Masala Dosa, complete with IDs, names, categories, descriptions, and availability. I have now also added items for a children\'s special section, and included popcorn.\n\n\n**Adding Salad Varieties**\n\nI am now focusing on expanding the item catalog with more offerings. I\'m building out children\'s options with a sugar candy and sweet corn. In addition, I have added the Salad-e-Bahar items: garden green salad, cheese & tomato salad, kachumber salad, and channa chat. I\'ve ensured each entry has an ID, name, category, description, and availability, and set initial prices to zero.\n\n\n**Adding Curd Selections**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the \"Salad-e-Bahar\" section, adding Beans Sprouted Salad, Cheese Salad, Sirka Onion, Pasta Salad, and Assorted Achar & Papad, ensuring complete data. I\'ve started the \"CURD BAR\" section, now including Mix Veg Raita.\n\n\n**Expanding Curd & Rice Options**\n\nI\'m expanding the menu, and have created several entries under the CURD BAR section. These include Mix Veg, Pineapple, and Boondi Raitas. I\'ve now begun the RICE COUNTER, adding Navrattan Pulao, Corn Rice, and Jeera Rice. I am ensuring that I don\'t miss anything.\n\n\n**Adding Mughlai Dishes**\n\nI\'m now populating the Vegetable Mughlai Food section. I\'ve added dishes like Lahori Paneer, Kashmiri Dum Aloo, Palak Corn, Cheese Butter Masala, Mix Veg, and Methi Malai Mutter. Each item entry has its id, name, category, description, price (zero initially), and availability.\n\n\n**Adding Punjabi Dishes**\n\nI\'m now adding items for Punjabi Desi Rasoi, like Kadhi Pakora, Saag with Makki Roti (marked as a best-seller), Karele Masala, and Aloo Gobhi. I\'m focusing on descriptive details, setting availability, and starting prices at zero. Consistency remains a key focus.\n\n\n**Completing Punjabi Section**\n\nI\'m finalizing the Punjabi Desi Rasoi section, adding Aloo Methi, Gajjar Mater, Rajma Raseela, Bhindi Masala, and Baingan Bhartha. I\'m focusing on consistency in formatting and detail. Then I\'m moving on to Amritsari Spl.\n\n\n**Finalizing Amritsari Options**\n\nI\'ve just added Amritsari Chana, Kulcha, Dal, and Chatni, ensuring each includes essential details. I\'ve also completed the Dal Counter section with Dal Makhni and Yellow Dal Tadka, and Dal Makhni is marked as a best-seller. I am ready to publish the menu.\n\n\n**Adding Oriental Delights**\n\nI\'m now expanding the menu further. I\'ve just added entries to the Oriental Cuisine section, including Cheese Chilly, Veg Manchurian, Veg Hakka Noodles, and Fried Rice, each with their IDs, names, categories, descriptions, and availability. Then, I am focusing on the bread section.\n\n\n**Cataloging Bread & Dessert**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the \"INDIAN BREADS\" section, adding options such as plain rotis and various parathas. Then, I have added entries for \"DELIGHTFUL DESSERT\", which includes hot Gulab Jamun, Rasmalai, Moon Kheer, and Jalebi Rabri, each now complete with required details.\n\n\n**Defining Dessert & Halwa**\n\nI\'m now populating the Dessert and Halwa categories. I\'ve added Shahi Tukda, Tila Kulfi, and hot Kaser Milk, as well as Halwa options such as Moong Dal, Lokhi, and Gajar ka. I\'m ensuring detailed descriptions and availability. Now, I will start to build out the Ice Cream counter section.\n\n\n**Adding Ice Cream Selections**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the Ice Cream Counter section, beginning with Assorted Ice Cream. I\'m also adding During Pherree items like coffee/tea, water bottles, Kaju Katli, and assorted dry fruits. I then added Whiskey Spl items, including water bottles.\n\n\n**Populating Whiskey Selections**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the \'WHISKEY SPL.\' items, adding soda, ice cubes, peanut masala, chakna, dry papad, masala papad, and corn chaat. I\'m ensuring all items have complete details and a zero initial price. I\'ve now finished the catalog.\n\n\n"
